---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import HighlightPhrase from './HighlightPhrase.astro';
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
import teachingMusic from '../assets/teaching-music.jpg';
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="inner">
    <SectionHead number="03" label="About" title="Music classroom to AI lab." tone="violet" />
    <div class="about">
      <div class="photo">
        <div class="frame">
          <Image src={teachingMusic} alt="Frazier Smith conducting a music ensemble — a literal music classroom, before the AI lab" widths={[360, 540, 720]} sizes="(max-width: 720px) 280px, 400px" />
        </div>
        <div class="badge">
          <span class="step a">Classroom</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="step b">Enterprise</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span class="step c">Classroom</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text">
        <p>Through college, while majoring in music education, I worked in campus ed-tech. My first job after graduating kicked off a decade in enterprise instructional design and technical training — building and delivering courses for working engineers. I came back to higher ed by adjuncting at a community college, grew that into a full-time role, then department chair, and circled back to my alma mater to teach applied AI.</p>
        <div class="pullquote">
          "I left a classroom to learn <HighlightPhrase text="what to teach" phrase="what to teach" />. I came back to teach it."
        </div>
        <p>Along the way: instructional design and training roles at Belk, CPI Security, SnapAV, and Anomali; senior leadership at VMware, Broadcom, and Fast Lane — including a 12-person VMware content team whose work drove $40M in annual customer revenue; and now chair of an IT department at Central Piedmont spanning Cybersecurity, Cloud &amp; Networking, and IT Support — alongside graduate teaching at UNC Charlotte and Honors-program AI at Wingate.</p>
        <p><a class="more" href="/about">Read the full story →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: var(--space-section) 0;
    background: var(--sun);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .inner { max-width: var(--container-max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--space-page-x); }
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 400px 1fr; gap: 0; align-items: start; background: var(--white); }
  .photo { background: var(--ink); }
  .frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .badge {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: stretch;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .badge .step { padding: 12px 12px; flex: 1 1 auto; text-align: center; }
  .badge .step.a { background: var(--violet); color: var(--white); }
  .badge .step.b { background: var(--teal); color: var(--ink); }
  .badge .step.c { background: var(--coral); color: var(--ink); }
  .badge .arr { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 8px; color: var(--sun); background: var(--ink); }
  .text { padding: 36px 40px 30px; }
  .text p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .pullquote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-stretch: 112%;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin: 22px 0;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    background: var(--violet);
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .more {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .more:hover { background: var(--violet); color: var(--white); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .text { padding: 26px 22px 22px; }
  }
</style>
